{"id": "RT-guide-static-about-adhd-resources", "body": {"t": "main", "a": {"id": "main-content", "class": "wrap"}, "c": [{"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/"}, "c": ["MJB ADHD home"]}, " · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/"}, "c": ["Guidebook"]}]}, {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/"}, "c": ["MJB ADHD"]}, " · Static reading view · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/#/n/adhd-resources"}, "c": ["Interactive version"]}]}, {"t": "h1", "c": ["ADHD resources: find what you need"]}, {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "small", "c": ["Status: drafted · Content checked 2026-10-07"]}]}, {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "lede"}, "c": ["Purpose-labelled links for medication questions, shared care, peer support, work, books, podcasts and practical tools."]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "1"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Choose your purpose"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["You do not need to read everything. Pick the question you have today, open one resource, and keep anything useful with your appointment notes."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["This directory brings together public resources from ADHD Direct’s recommendations, with additional official links where they help. Every entry explains its purpose and what kind of source it is. No personal clinical correspondence is reproduced here."]}, " ", {"t": "ul", "c": [{"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Medication or shared care:"]}, " start with the NHS overview, the clinic explainers and the exact product leaflet."]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Day-to-day support:"]}, " try one practical video, support group or simple tool."]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Work:"]}, " check the official Access to Work route."]}, {"t": "li", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Longer reading or listening:"]}, " choose a book or podcast by topic, format and energy available."]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "2"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Medication, care and related questions"]}, {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "adhd-resources--nhs-adhd-in-adults"}, "c": ["NHS: ADHD in adults"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful for:"]}, " Start with an overview of adult ADHD, assessment and treatment."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " Clinical information. Official NHS patient information."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/adhd-adults/", "rel": "noopener", "target": "_blank"}, "c": ["Open this resource"]}, " · ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-RES-NHS"}, "c": ["RES-NHS"]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "adhd-resources--adhd-direct-is-adhd-medication-even-real"}, "c": ["ADHD Direct: Is ADHD Medication Even Real?"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful for:"]}, " Prepare questions about medication and common misconceptions."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " Provider explanation. A clinic-authored explainer; individual treatment decisions belong with your prescriber."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://adhddirect.co.uk/blog/is-adhd-medication-even-real-lets-talk-about-it/", "rel": "noopener", "target": "_blank"}, "c": ["Open this resource"]}, " · ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-RES-MEDICATION"}, "c": ["RES-MEDICATION"]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "adhd-resources--adhd-direct-shared-care-explained"}, "c": ["ADHD Direct: shared care explained"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful for:"]}, " Understand the provider’s explanation of why a GP might decline shared care."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " Provider explanation. A private provider’s account, not a binding statement of the law or your local commissioning policy. Use alongsi