hallenges."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " Practical information. US-based resource. Its healthcare, employment and education rules are not UK rules."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.understood.org/", "rel": "noopener", "target": "_blank"}, "c": ["Open this resource"]}, " · ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-RES-UNDERSTOOD"}, "c": ["RES-UNDERSTOOD"]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "adhd-resources--access-to-work"}, "c": ["Access to Work"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful for:"]}, " Check the support available for disability-related difficulties at work and how to apply."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " Government scheme. Official guidance for England, Scotland and Wales. Eligibility and awarded support are assessed; Northern Ireland has a separate route."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.gov.uk/access-to-work", "rel": "noopener", "target": "_blank"}, "c": ["Open this resource"]}, " · ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-RES-ATW"}, "c": ["RES-ATW"]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "adhd-resources--adhd-and-driving-gov-uk"}, "c": ["ADHD and driving — GOV.UK"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful for:"]}, " Check the current DVLA notification guidance rather than relying on a social-media answer."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " Government guidance. Official Great Britain guidance; use the linked rules for your licence category and circumstances."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.gov.uk/adhd-and-driving", "rel": "noopener", "target": "_blank"}, "c": ["Open this resource"]}, " · ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": 