: ["Useful for:"]}, " Explore approaches to building routines and changing the surrounding environment."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " General self-help book. General habit advice, not an ADHD-specific clinical reference or evidence that disability can be overcome by willpower."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://jamesclear.com/atomic-habits", "rel": "noopener", "target": "_blank"}, "c": ["Open this resource"]}, " · ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-RES-HABITS"}, "c": ["RES-HABITS"]}]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "5"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Podcasts and practical tools"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Apps support a task or routine; they are not treatments in themselves. Pricing, permissions and accessibility can change. Choose a format that works for you."]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "adhd-resources--the-adhd-adults-podcast"}, "c": ["The ADHD Adults Podcast"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful for:"]}, " Listen to UK adult ADHD discussion, information and personal experiences."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " Podcast. Podcast format; individual episodes mix explanation and lived experience."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://theadhdadults.uk/", "rel": "noopener", "target": "_blank"}, "c": ["Open this resource"]}, " · ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-RES-POD-ADULT"}, "c": ["RES-POD-ADULT"]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "h3", "a": {"id": "adhd-resources--additude-adhd-experts-podcast"}, "c": ["ADDitude ADHD Experts Podcast"]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Useful for:"]}, " Find topic-specific expert discussions, episodes and accompanying slides."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "strong", "c": ["Source type:"]}, " We